              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NAM.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nah 1:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.10.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 10:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.6.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ef 6:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiend ng’atu m’ukelo rwonglembe ma ber wi gudi ber mire ma, m’urieyo kwiocwiny, m’ukelo rwonglembe ma ber mi gin ma ber m’urieyo pi both, m’uwacu ni Sayuni kumae, Mungu peri camu ker mire! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwand jukur peri mire! giting’o dwal, giwero wer karacelo; kum gibineno wang’ ku wang’, kinde ma Yehova dwogo i Sayuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wumoj wer mi mutoro, wuwer karacelo, wu kar uvuru mi Yerusalem; kum Yehova juko dhanu pare, ewaru Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wanyu bote ma leng’ i wang’ thek ceke; man kajik mi ng’om ngung’ uneno both pa Mungu mwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.6.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 6:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuai, wuai, wuai ku kuno, kud wumul gin m’ucido; wuai kud i kinde; wudwokru giwu leng’, wu ju m’uyeyo agulu pa Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum wubiwok woko ku ng’wec ungo, kadok aringa de wubicidho ngo: kum Yehova bicidho i weng’wu; man Mungu mir Israel bibedo ni jamgwok i ng’eiwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, jatic para bitimo ku rieko, jubidode man jubiting’e malu, man ebibedo malu hai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Calu i dhanu dupa wang’ lii i kumi (junyotho wang’e ma sagu dhanu mange ceke, man kite ma sagu wot dhanu), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.15.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 15:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e ebipoyo thek dupa kumeca; ju m’ubimo bimio dhoggi i kume: kum gibineno gin ma fodi jukuyero igi ngo: man gin ma giwinjo ngo gibing’eyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.15"
            ]
          }
        }
